                Welcome to C-Net Amiga Empire Version 2.01


 Included in this LZH are:
 
  Emp.Readme     The file you are reading now
  Emp.Readme1    Main Empire Instructions
  Emp.Readme2    Empire Maintenance Instructions (Emp.Maint) 
  Emp.Readme3    Empire Utilities Instructions   (Emp.Util)
  Emp.Readme4    Empire Status Instructions      (Emp.Info!)
  2.01.LHA       Empire Files

The easiest way to install Empire is to unLHA the 2.01.LHA into
a TEMP directory (In RAM if you have enough Memory).  Then execute
the 'Execute.Me' script to set up all the needed directories and copy 
all the files.  After the script has been executed, the TEMP directory
can be deleted. 

'Empire' 	should be added as an AREXX file to the PFILES section.
         	This is the main program that starts the game.  For more 
	 	information about this file and it's installation read the
         	Emp.Readme1 file.

'Emp.Maint' 	can be added as an AREXX file to the PFILES section and 
		should be added into the BBSEVENT files to run everynight
		during automaintenance.  See Emp.Readme2 for details.

'Emp.Util'	should be added as an AREXX file to the PFILES section with
 		access set for Sysops only.  See Emp.Readme3 for details.

'Emp.Info!'	can be added as an AREXX file to the PFILES section or
		can be added into the SYS.WELCOME file to run during logon
		to give Empire game/player info.  See Emp.Readme4 for details.

The other Readme files will give more detailed information about the
game options, installation and changes that v2.01 brings.  

If you are updating from an Empire version below v1.3 and want to keep the
old players you MUST run the Emp.Update AREXX program from the 2.01.LHA.
This program will update the old files to the new faster file format used
by Empire v1.3 and above.  If you are upgrading from Empire v1.3 or above,
the players file can be used without running Emp.Update.

If you find that this PFILE does not meet with your satisfaction, please 
let us know what we can do to make it better.

If you find that this PFILE does meet with your satisfaction, please consider
the registration.  Empire registration is given with a donation of at least
$25.  Upon registering, you will have access to the latest versions of Empire
and all future versions.  You can also receive your own personalized Emp.ID
by calling one of the BBS numbers listed below.  You can register by
contacting either Me (Crazy Cad) or John (Warren Peace).  

